<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Tolmex 9-mo net soars.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Tolmex 9-mo net soars.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Oper Income     1.063 bln		949.2 million</p>
<p>	Net Profit	2.36 bln		 388.4 million</p>
